1. Problem Statement
Cross-evaluate student records across four distinct audit stages: Fee Clearance (Rs.0 pending), Attendance Eligibility (>=75%), Internal Assessment Criteria (>=20/50), and Exam Hall Ticket issuance eligibility, reporting precise reasons for any hold.
2. Objectives
•	Perform multi-criteria integrated student auditing.
•	Generate specific, multi-reason non-eligibility reports.
•	Issue hall ticket authorization flags.
3. Assumptions
•	A student must pass ALL four conditions simultaneously to receive a hall ticket.
4. Algorithm
1. Read student audit dictionary records.
2. Check Fee Due == 0.
3. Check Attendance >= 75%.
4. Check Internal Marks >= 20.
5. Collect all failure reasons in a list.
6. If reason list is empty -> Eligible = True; else Eligible = False.
7. Output audit table and reason log.
